Subject: [PATCH 2/2] fix: accept opcode 1 as map-ready signal

The 1.5.5 client answers the 0x4000 board-init with a type 299 inner opcode 1
and never sends the documented opcode 0. The server only treated 0 as
"map ready", so it waited for the full 90 s map_load_timeout while the client
stayed frozen on the loading screen.

Observed (fix absent):

    game_admitted
    richonline_map_load_wait timeout_ms=90000
    game_received type=299 payload_bytes=13
    richonline_game_received opcode=1 plain_bytes=2
    (no further game_transport for 90 s)

Treat 1 like 0, keeping the existing map_loaded de-duplication so repeated
signals do not resend the snapshot or opening turn.

After the fix:

    richonline_map_ready_via_opcode1
    richonline_game_sent opcode=16400 / 16401 / 16911 / 24602 ...
    client enters the board

---
 server/src/richonline_game_startup.cpp | 12 +++++++++++-
 1 file changed, 11 insertions(+), 1 deletion(-)

diff --git a/server/src/richonline_game_startup.cpp b/server/src/richonline_game_startup.cpp
--- a/server/src/richonline_game_startup.cpp
+++ b/server/src/richonline_game_startup.cpp
@@ -115,7 +115,17 @@
         if (opcode == 0 || opcode == 1 || opcode == 2 || opcode == 10) {
             if (plain.size() != 2) throw CodecError("richonline_game_signal_length_invalid");
-            if (opcode == 1) return {};
+            if (opcode == 1) {
+                // Local verification: the 1.5.5 client sends 1 instead of 0 after 0x4000.
+                // Treat it as map-ready; never resend once loaded.
+                if (map_loaded) return {};
+                auto messages = std::vector<Bytes>{encode_richonline_board_snapshot(plan->snapshot)};
+                auto opening = plan->map_ready();
+                messages.insert(messages.end(), std::make_move_iterator(opening.begin()), std::make_move_iterator(opening.end()));
+                auto result = output(messages);
+                map_loaded = true;
+                map_loading_deadline.reset();
+                if (log) log("richonline_map_ready_via_opcode1");
+                return result;
+            }
             if (opcode == 0) {
